    {
      "id": "f8UTKnAyq6FG7OfFk3s6T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 213.61587158546803,
      "y": 1357.4460536038537,
      "width": 995.5048241610422,
      "height": 201.60000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1150277655,
      "version": 500,
      "versionNonce": 182669591,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793816422395,
      "created": 1793816287552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gateway to Broker\n- Http Commands Expressed as Intents\nGateway to Query\n- GET requests returned as read only versioned data\nBroker to Gateway\n- Fulfillment or apologies of intents (if doing SSE, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gateway to Broker\n- Http Commands Expressed as Intents\nGateway to Query\n- GET requests returned as read only versioned data\nBroker to Gateway\n- Fulfillment or apologies of intents (if doing SSE, etc.)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LieMWQS7nVg6AWWBasnj_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1310.715528168284,
      "y": 1216.1422527453458,
      "width": 984.375,
      "height": 537.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 580767129,
      "version": 464,
      "versionNonce": 1927526096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793820548583,
      "created": 1793816424178,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Intents:\n\n\"I intend to add a vendor\"\n\nOperation: \"AddVendor\" -> \"Vendor is Added\"\n                        -> \"Need to apologize - can't do it\"\nOperands: a9393\nData: Name, POC, etc.\n\n\n\"I intend to change a POC\"\n\n\"I intend to add a catalog item\"\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Intents:\n\n\"I intend to add a vendor\"\n\nOperation: \"AddVendor\" -> \"Vendor is Added\"\n                        -> \"Need to apologize - can't do it\"\nOperands: a9393\nData: Name, POC, etc.\n\n\n\"I intend to change a POC\"\n\n\"I intend to add a catalog item\"\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dUy261J5AXZcY2qVACSTN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 242.92688573020132,
      "y": 1796.2513252956783,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 235.20000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ar",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1061270327,
      "version": 260,
      "versionNonce": 569296217,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793816635978,
      "created": 1793816569607,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does \"Vendors\" own (inside) and what does\nit need (references from outside)\n\n- Owns list of approved vendors\n- Owns list of vendor POC\n- Needs list of SoftwareCenter Managers (or gw)\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does \"Vendors\" own (inside) and what does it need (references from outside)\n\n- Owns list of approved vendors\n- Owns list of vendor POC\n- Needs list of SoftwareCenter Managers (or gw)\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rp3wSkhVdgvgOgO8DGRnq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1335.318883389821,
      "y": 1803.247001190344,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 168,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2006988793,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 1345816377,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793816677596,
      "created": 1793816641205,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does the catalog own (inside) and what does\nit need (references from outside)?\n\n- Owns list of the catalog items\n- Needs vendor list",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does the catalog own (inside) and what does it need (references from outside)?\n\n- Owns list of the catalog items\n- Needs vendor list",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WasFSQonAQqcD0sSG1Oc7",
