      "seed": 290775095,
      "version": 229,
      "versionNonce": 592627447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793816753678,
      "created": 1793816710391,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does licensing own (inside) and what does \nit need (references from the outside)?\n\n- Owns - license cost information, process\naround that.\n- Needs - catalog\n- Needs - vendors",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does licensing own (inside) and what does \nit need (references from the outside)?\n\n- Owns - license cost information, process around that.\n- Needs - catalog\n- Needs - vendors",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "erwl2WWN6OEXazsw7WTn6",
