      "updated": 1793821686726,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kafka\n    - Replicated across various services,\n    - can guarantee easily at least once delivery\n    - can do exactly once, but it's \"expensive\" (not money, resources)\n    - You partition your apps.",
